  "contentHtml": "<p>&lt; 경기도 화성오산에 근무하시는 선생님들께&gt;&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>운암고 혁신학교 컨퍼런스에 초대합니다.</p><p>저도 과학수업 공개합니다.</p><p>수업공개 주제는 &#39;교사와 학생이 함께 성장하는 수업나눔&#39;입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>와주시면 영광입니다~&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a7c7598bdff52c30478fbd2fc4e15295ddbf76c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a7c7598bdff52c30478fbd2fc4e15295ddbf76c\" data-origin-width=\"909\" data-origin-height=\"618\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec14a448408d56f69d77706ae4b4399a27d0a235\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec14a448408d56f69d77706ae4b4399a27d0a235\" data-origin-width=\"845\" data-origin-height=\"226\"></div><p><b>이번주 (금)까지 경기메신저로 신청하시면 됩니다~</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>자세한 내용은</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1fb47caff5eccbc7d234aa8809574d493d820fe1?download\" data-file-name=\"2022 혁신학교 컨퍼런스 운영 계획(홈페이지).hwp\" data-file-size=\"61952\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DKIr%26dataid%3D1623%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20220518141035&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F1fb47caff5eccbc7d234aa8809574d493d820fe1')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">2022 혁신학교 컨퍼런스 운영 계획(홈페이지)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">60.50KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
